{"total_count":13,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/16144","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/16144/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/16144/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/16144/events","html_url":"https://github.com/hyprwm/Hyprland/pull/16144","id":5352130902,"node_id":"PR_kwDOHA7HmM8AAAABCP6bEw","number":16144,"title":"window: add helper function to scan for empty subsurfaces before denying solitary","user":{"login":"LionHeartP","id":28869010,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4ODY5MDEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28869010?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LionHeartP","html_url":"https://github.com/LionHeartP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LionHeartP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LionHeartP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LionHeartP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LionHeartP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LionHeartP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LionHeartP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LionHeartP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LionHeartP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LionHeartP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":7059807197,"node_id":"LA_kwDOHA7HmM8AAAABpMwb3Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/labels/core","name":"core","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":7061058942,"node_id":"LA_kwDOHA7HmM8AAAABpN81fg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/labels/render","name":"render","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":7061257805,"node_id":"LA_kwDOHA7HmM8AAAABpOI-TQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/labels/desktop","name":"desktop","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-04T19:21:15Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T19:21:48Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/pulls/16144","html_url":"https://github.com/hyprwm/Hyprland/pull/16144","diff_url":"https://github.com/hyprwm/Hyprland/pull/16144.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/hyprwm/Hyprland/pull/16144.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"#### Describe your PR, what does it fix/add?\r\nAnother attempt at #16131 \r\nAfter https://github.com/hyprwm/Hyprland/pull/15958 and the release of GE-Proton 11-6 which fixes Steam overlay in wine-wayland, Solitary is denied for Proton because of an empty surface that is created.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a helper function for the subsurface buffer being empty before denying Solitary and allows Direct Scanout to engage. When the, now working, Steam Overlay is brought up, Hyprland correctly blocks Solitary and Direct Scanout until the Overlay is closed.\r\n\r\nTested with the following:\r\n`direct_scanout = 1`\r\n - Plezy, when fullscreened, is granted Solitary and Direct Scanout until a video starts playing. When the latter happens, solitary is blocked with \"not opaque, subsurfaces\" as intended. That means the mpv overlay is rendered and the video is not just a black frame.\r\n  - Proton-GE 11-6 games get granted Solitary now (previously blocked by \"not opaque, subsurfaces\" AT ALL TIMES), until you invoke the Steam overlay. At that moment, the helper function returns `nullptr` for because `if (surf && (surf->m_current.buffer || surf->m_mapped))`, blocking Solitary correctly, and rendering the overlay and the mouse while everything can be interacted with properly.\r\n  - Games running directly on wine show no change with this PR vs. without. Solitary and DS both engage and work fine.\r\n  -  Every other app when fullscreened, if no overlays or anything is involved, have Direct Scanout engaged properly (i.e. Chromium/Kitty/etc.\r\n  \r\n`direct_scanout = 0`\r\nThis is where my previous attempt fell short. On this PR, with the changes to `Renderer.cpp` we fall back to the correct subsurface to render instead of the empty dummy one.\r\nEverything else already worked as expected anyway.\r\n\r\n#### Is there anything you want to mention? (unchecked code, possible bugs, found problems, breaking compatibility, etc.)\r\nAgain, needs testing in case I missed something obvious or there is an edge case I haven't thought of.\r\n\r\n#### Is it ready for merging, or does it need work?\r\nPossibly ready. Maybe the code can be trimmed down a bit. I'll take a look at it again hopefully in a couple of days when I'm going to be back from a trip.\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/16144/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/16144/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/15435","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/15435/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/15435/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/15435/events","html_url":"https://github.com/hyprwm/Hyprland/pull/15435","id":4902777688,"node_id":"PR_kwDOHA7HmM7yi7nZ","number":15435,"title":"Allow pointer constraints to work on subsurface","user":{"login":"Shiphan","id":140245703,