m Overlay is brought up, Hyprland correctly blocks Solitary and Direct Scanout until the Overlay is closed.\r\n\r\nAlso setup a quick Plex server to test with Plezy, and verified Solitary is blocked when playing a video so there's no regression there.\r\n\r\n#### Is there anything you want to mention? (unchecked code, possible bugs, found problems, breaking compatibility, etc.)\r\nIt's possible this doesn't deny Solitary in an edge case I can't think of atm...\r\n\r\n#### Is it ready for merging, or does it need work?\r\nReady.\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/16131/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/16131/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/15446","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/15446/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/15446/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/15446/events","html_url":"https://github.com/hyprwm/Hyprland/pull/15446","id":4904720292,"node_id":"PR_kwDOHA7HmM7ypQOH","number":15446,"title":"protocols: fix nested subsurface ancestry","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":7059807197,"node_id":"LA_kwDOHA7HmM8AAAABpMwb3Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/labels/core","name":"core","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":7060594183,"node_id":"LA_kwDOHA7HmM8AAAABpNgeBw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/labels/protocols","name":"protocols","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-16T18:03:32Z","updated_at":"2026-07-18T12:55:26Z","closed_at":"2026-07-18T12:55:26Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/pulls/15446","html_url":"https://github.com/hyprwm/Hyprland/pull/15446","diff_url":"https://github.com/hyprwm/Hyprland/pull/15446.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/hyprwm/Hyprland/pull/15446.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What changed\n\n- Walk each current subsurface role while resolving nested offsets and top-level parents.\n- Stop safely when a parent link or subsurface resource has expired.\n- Reject a `get_subsurface` request whose parent advertises a stale subsurface role.\n- Fall back safely when preferred color-description lookup cannot resolve a subsurface ancestor.\n\n## Why\n\nThe ancestry loops repeatedly read the original parent role instead of the surface currently being visited. For nested subsurfaces this duplicated one offset and could return the wrong top-level parent; stale weak links could also be dereferenced.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Built the affected compositor and subcompositor objects in the isolated branch.\n- Built `hyprland_gtests` with this branch in an aggregate based on current `upstream/main`.\n- All 269 aggregate tests pass.\n- `clang-format` and `git diff --check` pass.\n\nThe current unit harness does not instantiate `wl_subsurface` protocol resources, so this path remains integration-tested.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/15446/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/15446/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/15445","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/15445/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/15445/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/15445/events","html_url":"https://github.com/hyprwm/Hyprland/pull/15445","id":4904720193,"node_id":"PR_kwDOHA7HmM7ypQMt","number":15445,"title":"protocols: default subsurfaces to synchronized","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":7059807197,"node_id":"LA_kwDOHA7HmM8AAAABpMwb3Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/labels/core","name":"core","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":7060594183,"node_id":"LA_kwDOHA7HmM8AAAABpNgeBw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/labels/protocols","name":"protocols","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-16T18:03:32Z","updated_at":"2026-07-18T12:55:26Z","closed_at":"2026-07-18T12:55:26Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/pulls/15445","html_url":"https://github.com/hyprwm/Hyprland/pull/15445","diff_url":"https://github.com/hyprwm/Hyprland/pull/15445.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/hyprwm/Hyprland/pull/15445.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What changed\n\n- Initialize each new `wl_subsurface` in synchronized mode.\n\n## Why\n\nThe Wayland core protocol specifies synchronized mode as the initial state. Starting desynchronized could apply a child's first commit independently of its parent before the client explicitly requested that behavior.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Built the affected subcompositor users in an aggregate based on current `upstream/main`.\n- All 269 aggregate tests pass.\n- `git diff --check` passes.\n\nThe current unit harness does not instantiate `wl_subsurface` protocol resources, so this one-line protocol-default correction has no direct unit test.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/15445/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/15445/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/15645","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/15645/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/15645/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/15645/events","html_url":"https://github.com/hyprwm/Hyprland/pull/15645","id":5006338990,"node_id":"PR_kwDOHA7HmM731NvB","number":15645,"title":"compositor: double buffered states needs their own bit","user":{"login":"gulafaran","id":773455,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MzQ1NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/773455?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gulafaran","html_url":"https://github.com/gulafaran","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gulafaran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gulafaran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gulafaran/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gulafaran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gulafaran/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gulafaran/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gulafaran/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gulafaran/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gulafaran/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":7059807197,"node_id":"LA_kwDOHA7HmM8AAAABpMwb3Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/labels/core","name":"core","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":7060594183,"node_id":"LA_kwDOHA7HmM8AAAABpNgeBw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/labels/protocols","name":"protocols","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-07-29T06:50:23Z","updated_at":"2026-08-02T09:53:37Z","closed_at":"2026-07-29T14:20:08Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/pulls/15645","html_url":"https://github.com/hyprwm/Hyprland/pull/15645","diff_url":"https://github.com/hyprwm/Hyprland/pull/15645.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/hyprwm/Hyprland/pull/15645.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-29T14:20:08Z"},"body":"6484f43 introduced state merging, which showed a flaw with mako. a second commit with just changing geometry was handled as a \"empty\" commit and ignored. all protocols that listen to commit and is double buffered as in state applied on next commit needs their own updated.bits.flag to ensure the statequeue knows something is pending.\r\n\r\nsynced subsurface also needs to set the parent flag, because its waiting for it to commit.\r\n\r\nwe also have to widen the union to uint32_t, we are running out of bits.\r\n\r\nfixes: https://github.com/hyprwm/Hyprland/discussions/15641\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/15645/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/15645/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/11135","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/11135/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/11135/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/11135/events","html_url":"https://github.com/hyprwm/Hyprland/is