sting. The presentation feedback part should solve potential issues with #14718\r\n\r\n#### Is it ready for merging, or does it need work?\r\nReady","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/14765/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyprwm/Hyprland/issues/14765/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}